								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "A method with no `^` answers `self`. When the `ifFound:` brnach fell through, `lookupTypeNamed:in:` answered the importer, whihc surfaced far away as `GtSmaCCKotlinImporter did not understand #subInheritances`. A `^` inside a blcok is a non-local return from the whole method, so every branch needs one or the method needs a single return at the top."
						},
