								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "`inject:into:` starting from nil builds a namespace chain. The first names goes to `ensureRootNamespace:`, each later one to `ensureNamespace:in:` with the previous result. `importNamespaces` amd `ensureNamespaceOfImport:` are the same fold over different names."
